This folder contains miscellaneous programs related to SiB4.

-------------------------------------------------------------
IDL PROGRAMS
-------------------------------------------------------------

map_sitelist.pro
-----------------
Creates a map of site/tower locations.

plotsib_pftfrac.pro
--------------------
Creates maps of the PFT distribution in SiB4.

-------------------------------------------------------------
-------------------------------------------------------------
All programs beginning with "sib_" plot the
physiological, phenological, and stress functions in SiB4.
-------------------------------------------------------------

sib_climp.pro
--------------
Climatological suitability.

sib_crassim.pro
----------------
Canopy assimilation respiration scalar.

sib_ltdaylen.pro
----------------
Leaf transfer from daylength response.

sib_ltdry.pro
-----------------
Leaf transfer from dry response.

sib_ltfreeze.pro
----------------
Leaf transfer from freezing conditions.

sib_mrfreeze.pro
-----------------
Respiration inhibition from freezing conditions.

sib_mrhot.pro
-------------
Respiration increase from high temperatures.

sib_mrprecip.pro
-----------------
Respiration inhibition from dry conditions,
   using seasonal precipitation.

sib_psdaylen.pro
----------------
Phenology stage daylength potential.

sib_psgrowth.pro
----------------
Phenology stage growth index.

sib_rstfac1.pro
---------------
Humidity stress factor.

sib_rstfac2.pro
---------------
Soil moisture stress factor.

sib_rstfac3.pro
---------------
Temperature stress factor.

sib_rtmoist.pro
----------------
Respiration changes from soil moisture.

sib_soil.pro
-------------
Soil properties.

